kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeinputtagcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcontentfocus","abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token colors.actionFocus (= light: “#000000AD” \/ dark: “#FFFFFFA3”)","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of tag input","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSInputTag"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllInputTagComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InputTagComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"tag inputs","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tag inputs","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeinputtagcomponenttokensprovider","title":"OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProvider/colorBorderPressed":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorBorderPressed","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken"}],"title":"colorBorderPressed","abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token colors.actionPressed (= light: “#F15E00FF” \/ dark: “#FF7900FF”)","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeinputtagcomponenttokensprovider\/colorborderpressed","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeInputTagComponentTokensProv